# ── Built skill artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Distributed via GitHub Releases (built by tooling/build_skill.py), never committed.
/dist/
*.skill

# ── Personal / real candidate data — NEVER commit ────────────────────────
# The skill source ships only fictional placeholder data; real data lives in
# the user's Claude project files, not in this repo.
CV_*.docx
*_b64.txt
signature*.txt
Applications_Tracker_*.csv
Suivi_Candidatures_*.csv
# (the bundled neutral letter template Cover_letter_template.docx is NOT matched
#  by the CV_*.docx rule above and IS committed as part of the skill source.)

# ── Internal working docs — not for the public repo ──────────────────────
# The roadmap is an internal progression log that references real data
# (companies applied to, maintainer name). It lives in the Claude project,
# never in this public repository. This pattern is a safety net in case a
# copy ever lands in the working tree.
ROADMAP_*.md

# ── Claude runtime / scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────
outputs/
/mnt/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ── OS / editors ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
